OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 15 JAN
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GOn Martin Luther King Jr.'s
OL,6,     Gbirthday, music to mark the
OL,7,     GAmerican civil rights leader by
OL,8,     GDuke Ellington and the first
OL,9,     Gsymphony by an American female
OL,10,     Gcomposer.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: Gottschalk
OL,12,     GDonald Macleod finds Louis Moreau
OL,13,     GGottschalk hitting a new low
OL,14,     Gbefore he eventually finds fame
OL,15,     Gin America.
OL,16,G1700FIn Tune
OL,17,     GKatie Derham welcomes pianist Tim
OL,18,     GHorton for a live performance.
OL,19,     GPoet Val McDermid and artistic
OL,20,     Gdirector Lewis Hetherington
OL,21,     Gdiscuss Out in the Hills Festival
OL,22,     Gin Pitlochry.
